.\" Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5-5
.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt EMACS 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm emacs
.Nd GNU Emacs 31 configuration with a Nix build layer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ql just run-built
.Op Ar args
.Pp
.Ql just test | nix-check | fmt | build
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This project is a GNU Emacs 31 configuration with a Nix build layer.
The floor is Emacs 31.1.
No framework such as Doom or Spacemacs lies underneath.
Nix builds the editor, and binary-cache parity is an invariant.
Modular Emacs Lisp configures it:
.Pa early-init.el ,
.Pa init.el
and one
.Pa lisp/init-*.el
file for each concern.
.Pp
The Nix expressions are
.Pa emacs.nix ,
.Pa overlay.nix ,
.Pa default.nix ,
.Pa module.nix
and
.Pa module-system.nix .
The tree's
.Pa nix/inputs.nix
builds the
.Ql emacs-config
attribute set from them.
.Pp
The project shell has tooling only: linters, language servers and the
documentation toolchain.
It has no Emacs.
Command
.Ql just run-built
builds the distribution and starts it with this configuration,
isolated from
.Pa ~/.emacs.d .
.Sh INSTALLATION
The attribute set
.Ql emacs-config
exposes the full distribution
.Pq Emacs and the tree-sitter grammars ,
a bare
.Ql emacs ,
a terminal-only
.Ql emacs-nox ,
a Home Manager module with the
.Ql services.emacsConfig
daemon, and a NixOS module.
The installation page of the website describes each way.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa init.el , Pa early-init.el
The entry points.
.It Pa lisp/
The feature modules, loaded from
.Pa init.el
in order.
.It Pa test/
The ERT suite.
See
.Xr emacs-testing 7 .
.It Pa docs/
The sources of the website and of the Info manual.
.It Pa docs/emacs-config.7.md
The source of the
.Ql emacs-config(7)
page that the website serves.
.It Pa etc/
The debug harness, the vendored elisp-doc and the language-evaluation registry.
.It Pa journal/
Working notes.
They can be stale; the code wins.
.It Pa AGENTS.md
The contributor guide: structure, commands, style and architecture notes.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr emacs-release-plan 7 ,
.Xr emacs-testing 7 ,
.Xr emacs-docs 8
.Pp
